  "description": "Logging infrastructure for .NET services. A Roslyn source generator produces compile-time, reflection-free logging decorators for any interface marked with [LoggingDecorator]. Decorators log method entry, parameters, return values, and exceptions with no runtime overhead.",
  "id": "CoreDesign.Logging",
